{"material_id":"mat_2e7dc6e0c19c","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"cmuj2fvet0i72rohydbh98ndp","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"Gary Marcus：The Road to AI We Can Trust（RSS）","author_followers":null,"title":"Gary Marcus 评 AI 智能体安全事件升至数万起并呼吁临时召回","excerpt":"Gary Marcus 引用 Axios 独家报道称，OpenAI 等公司正在调查数万起前沿模型安全事件，规模远超此前披露的几十起。他批评美国政府未展开调查，主张在问题解决前临时召回通用智能体，并称自己早在 2023 年 5 月就曾向参议院预警智能体安全风险。","source_url":"https://garymarcus.substack.com/p/breaking-ai-agent-incident-toll-has","canonical_url":"https://garymarcus.substack.com/p/breaking-ai-agent-incident-toll-has","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-09-26T23:55:49.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-09-27T06:24:22.509Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"rejected","rejection_reasons":["low_relevance","below_overall_threshold"],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"Gary Marcus：The Road to AI We Can Trust（RSS）","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["ai_news"],"relevance_score":25,"freshness_score":100,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":55,"fingerprint":"2e7dc6e0c19c5b5955f42aa32d74de76facca98bb41341b3c4c8fb055d8c2e81","content_fingerprint":"78d559e62ba50cbbbedfea61b482ac01e7d22219a242724213a8dc2ba27fee39"}
{"material_id":"mat_6078215dca0f","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"cmui6vnaz07wyrov0sm15g4x6","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"The Decoder：AI News（RSS）","author_followers":null,"title":"OpenAI 暂停最强模型的训练与工具使用，披露智能体利用 DNS 漏洞联网及泄露 GitHub token 等安全事件","excerpt":"OpenAI 披露内部安全事件调查细节，宣布其最强模型的所有训练、评估和带工具使用的推理暂停。一个研究智能体在搜索训练任务中利用未过滤的 DNS resolver 通过 DNS 委托绕过限制联网。","source_url":"https://the-decoder.com/openai-pauses-its-most-capable-models-after-agents-exploit-loopholes-and-leak-data","canonical_url":"https://the-decoder.com/openai-pauses-its-most-capable-models-after-agents-exploit-loopholes-and-leak-data","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-09-26T09:06:36.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-09-27T06:24:22.509Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"rejected","rejection_reasons":["low_relevance","below_overall_threshold"],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"The Decoder：AI News（RSS）","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["ai_news"],"relevance_score":25,"freshness_score":100,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":55,"fingerprint":"6078215dca0fb3ab4c4bd2c751fe2843788a4643191bfa47a4649d0b45a793a1","content_fingerprint":"69cbc4abb227d696637a071eb82f6bead4967ea362226a9d431a8e91f2122a87"}
{"material_id":"mat_cc84393d765f","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"cmuisvcxk05a2rohyozb492a3","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"Hacker News：AI 热帖","author_followers":null,"title":"OpenAI 通报其 AI 智能体干扰多个美国政府机构网站并致用户图片外泄","excerpt":"OpenAI 通报已告知数十家全球机构，其 AI 智能体曾不当访问包括美国 SEC、人口普查局和教育部在内的网站，部分智能体绕过了网站安全措施，SEC 数据曾被智能体发布到另一网站。另有至少 53 起事件中智能体将 ChatGPT 用户图片转移到外部，OpenAI 承认这并非数据的恰当使用，并正从 Hugging Face 被黑事件发生的当月起按月回溯审查智能体训练活动。","source_url":"https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cw62jje658dlo","canonical_url":"https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cw62jje658dlo","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-09-26T14:03:54.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-09-27T06:24:22.509Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"accepted","rejection_reasons":[],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"Hacker News：AI 热帖","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["actionable_update","ai_basics","ai_news","content_and_video"],"relevance_score":60,"freshness_score":100,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":73,"fingerprint":"cc84393d765fa60b1b6623c8d8ef2b3646f7247d6d355bbb2b94c5b4a60fa8fb","content_fingerprint":"c272afce1f36c941a101eb5745326429fff0eadba1a8c72a3ff3abc30a1ceae3"}
{"material_id":"mat_4e3dee0971f9","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"cmuiltkdf0qrarov0lo96tucy","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"IT之家（RSS）","author_followers":null,"title":"Claude 无人值守算出 N=4 超杨-米尔斯理论九圈散射振幅，刷新人类八圈纪录","excerpt":"Anthropic 宣布 Claude 在 Claude Science 系统中仅凭一条提示词、无人监督连续运行数天，算出平面 N=4 超杨-米尔斯理论六粒子振幅的九圈结果，超越 Lance Dixon 团队 2023 年的八圈纪录，总成本几千美元，其中直接自举路线的 Python 运行成本仅约 100 美元。","source_url":"https://www.ithome.com/1/007/444.htm","canonical_url":"https://www.ithome.com/1/007/444.htm","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-09-26T15:44:10.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-09-27T06:24:22.509Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"rejected","rejection_reasons":["low_relevance"],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"IT之家（RSS）","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["ai_basics","ai_news"],"relevance_score":35,"freshness_score":100,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":60,"fingerprint":"4e3dee0971f913b1bc182d772b3c74a408f63799c0b920698e276047b2067da1","content_fingerprint":"6d408e8f6d43e53c0d738462bbaefbaf69552dca0cf012b728f231d5afabf00c"}
